1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,786
WenQuest whiteboard lessons work like a teacher drawing on a whiteboard while

2
00:00:04,806 --> 00:00:05,234
talking.

3
00:00:05,254 --> 00:00:08,534
The AI writes the script, voices it and lays out the board.

4
00:00:09,554 --> 00:00:12,776
Give it a topic, or upload a recording of your own lecture,

5
00:00:12,796 --> 00:00:14,590
and it is ready in a few minutes.

6
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:18,341
Afterwards you can change any board and any line yourself.

7
00:00:19,361 --> 00:00:22,776
The pen draws stroke by stroke as the explanation goes,

8
00:00:22,796 --> 00:00:25,211
with board text in Chinese and English.

9
00:00:26,231 --> 00:00:30,734
How the ideas relate is drawn as one picture, with the key points in colour.

10
00:00:31,754 --> 00:00:32,468
The drawings move,

11
00:00:32,488 --> 00:00:35,077
and the lesson can drop in the course's own labs and animations,

12
00:00:35,097 --> 00:00:36,504
with robots as the running example.

13
00:00:37,524 --> 00:00:40,885
We use it to publish a whiteboard explainer every day;

14
00:00:40,905 --> 00:00:43,139
the latest ones are on our homepage.
